      <h2>Interested? Let Us Know</h2>
      <p>We're gauging interest to lock in the best deal for our Web3 community. Drop your info below and we'll keep you in the loop.</p>

      <a href="#interest-form" class="fenway-cta-wrapper" onclick="event.preventDefault(); document.getElementById('interest-form').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
        <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64aa957da446d8dc44869f81/69b8d937e2a5ef57890eeff3_Pavilion%20Hospitality%20Seat%20View.jpg" alt="Fenway Park Pavilion Hospitality View" class="fenway-cta-img" />
